      "why": "Nothing in the drop consumes zqcs_req: no scheduler or cmd_gen port accepts a ZQCS request, so periodic ZQ calibration can never be granted by the design itself \u2014 an integration gap (finding filed). The harness acks immediately so the calibration FSM does not wedge; the cal_zqcs monitor still observes every request."
    },
